{
  "name": "IIoT - Resumo diário de produção no WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resumo diário de produção\n\nA plataforma chama este webhook quando um dia de produção fecha (turnos encerrados e a máquina parada há 30 min, hora extra incluída) — **uma mensagem por vez**, das 07h às 21h e com no mínimo 3 min entre envios. Quem acumula os fechamentos das 17h e dá o ritmo é a fila da plataforma; aqui só se envia: o texto e, em seguida, as imagens de produção e de paradas de cada equipamento.\n\n1. Preencha **Configuração**.\n2. Ative e copie a URL de produção do nó **Resumo recebido** para a variável **N8N_SUMMARY_WEBHOOK_URL** da plataforma (Coolify).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "624d7d1b-4fca-406b-82a0-7d3462833bbb",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "everlenz-iiot-resumo",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b4de8e32-8489-4f15-a0b8-cdc962c18992",
      "name": "Resumo recebido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "ebada522-302c-460d-8b7b-93e221f28c1c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1470b0db-69b1-4356-95d6-66a65689ebed",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_URL",
              "value": "https://iotplataform.everlenz.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f1b691ec-957d-477f-b121-6902a2e1fdd9",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_CHAVE",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_N8N_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0c510f72-a077-4159-b285-7318db8890ba",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_URL",
              "value": "https://evolutionapi.assistentedrfin.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "21c1eee1-b6bc-4f73-a89a-2723f7729928",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA",
              "value": "NOME_DA_INSTANCIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2c1088dc-66c3-4532-b98b-5f7f8acb7476",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_APIKEY",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_APIKEY_DA_EVOLUTION",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3bec3b24-c024-4eb3-8853-62543d5368ef",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a28b3438-95f2-4ad4-8dde-e8cf3db18f5a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.headers['x-n8n-key'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7aac1ca9-729b-4e08-8feb-95faa86f3782",
      "name": "Chave válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b9ed53db-0057-498a-947f-63316a80f0e8",
      "name": "Ignora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.waitSeconds || 10 }}"
      },
      "id": "e26be3d6-62f4-4329-92d6-ab8e9d4351b8",
      "name": "Espera aleatória",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ String(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.url || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL) || '').replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/message/sendText/{{ encodeURIComponent(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.instance || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA)) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.apikey || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "delay",
              "value": "={{ 1500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 2500) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "presence",
              "value": "composing"
            },
            {
              "name": "linkPreview",
              "value": "={{ false }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "112b8c77-8f77-4b73-9881-a6fbc7c9e6f2",
      "name": "Envia resumo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "adcbf44a-56cb-4110-86d1-88c966ef294a",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "22c6f2c9-6be6-4fa8-9f5c-c2bbab0ee585",
      "name": "Tem imagens?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Produção e paradas de cada equipamento, na ordem em que a plataforma mandou.\nreturn ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).map((image) => ({ json: image }));"
      },
      "id": "11519e86-8784-44d7-a05b-90bab684df82",
      "name": "Separa imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "48573081-e156-4405-91cf-0f5c117e02ba",
      "name": "Uma imagem por vez",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ 3 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4) }}"
      },
      "id": "459a04f1-7560-435f-8f05-7f99e0fe0fde",
      "name": "Pausa entre imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ String(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.url || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL) || '').replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/message/sendMedia/{{ encodeURIComponent(($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.instance || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA)) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.evolution?.apikey || $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { number: $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number, mediatype: 'image', mimetype: $json.mimetype, caption: $json.caption, media: $json.base64, fileName: $json.fileName } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "d2b9f101-4ee7-4e20-8b3a-4ea021de8b2e",
      "name": "Envia imagem",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        -120
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6375c54f-b0b7-4658-94bf-6daaf82ab4ed",
      "name": "Confirma envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.message ?? 'falha na Evolution').slice(0, 400) } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "342666ed-490a-428f-a2d9-a404a13eb039",
      "name": "Registra falha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
